// lib/encoding.synl
//
// Standard library: encoding (Synth-OOP interface).
// 标准库：encoding（Synth-OOP 接口）。
//
// Human-readable face of the encoding library. Methods are given as signatures
// only; their behavior is supplied by the C++ backend in lib/cpp/encoding.hpp.
// On `&encoding;` the interpreter brings the native class online first, then
// interprets this file; the class is already registered, so its definition
// here is treated purely as documentation of the public shape. The `$Program`
// class, should one appear, is ignored in a library.
// encoding 库面向人类的形态。方法仅以签名给出，真实行为由
// lib/cpp/encoding.hpp 的 C++ 底层提供。程序写 `&encoding;` 时，解释器先上线
// 原生类，再解释本文件；该类已登记，此处定义仅作公开形态文档。库中出现
// `$Program` 时忽略。
//
// Codecs: base64 (RFC 4648), hex, URL percent-encoding (RFC 3986). All operate
// on std::String so binary payloads ride as raw byte strings.
// 编解码：base64（RFC 4648）、hex、URL 百分号编码（RFC 3986）。全部以
// std::String 输入输出，二进制载荷以原始字节串承载。

$Encoding {
    @base64_encode[(data[std::String]) ~> (text[std::String]) { }];
    @base64_decode[(text[std::String]) ~> (data[std::String]) { }];
    @hex[(data[std::String]) ~> (text[std::String]) { }];
    @unhex[(text[std::String]) ~> (data[std::String]) { }];
    @url_encode[(text[std::String]) ~> (text[std::String]) { }];
    @url_decode[(text[std::String]) ~> (text[std::String]) { }];
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// v1.30 preset object / v1.30 预置对象
//
// One ready-made entry point comes with the import. Declared in THIS file, so it
// uses the BARE name `Encoding`; the `encoding::` package index is added
// centrally by the `&encoding;` import, so external code calls it as
// `encoding::Encoding` (e.g. `encoding::Encoding.base64_encode(data)`,
// `encoding::Encoding.url_decode(text)`). The `::`-prefixed part is a package
// locator, not part of the name.
// 导入即附带一个成品入口。因声明在本文件内，使用裸名 `Encoding`；`encoding::` 包索引
// 由 `&encoding;` 导入集中添加，故外部以 `encoding::Encoding` 调用（如
// `encoding::Encoding.base64_encode(data)`、`encoding::Encoding.url_decode(text)`）。
// `::` 前缀是包定位符，而非名字的一部分。
// ------------------------------------------------------------
-(encoding::Encoding! encoding::Encoding);
